" :answer-field/id #uuid "a6756ef0-a496-5e5f-9a50-fbffec963e2a" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-c765a433-dc36-527e-91c8-b7188af16e20" :answer-field/choices ["answer-c765a433-dc36-527e-91c8-b7188af16e20" "answer-127d75f0-286e-540c-867f-af08497d27bf"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c765a433-dc36-527e-91c8-b7188af16e20" :answer/id #uuid "c765a433-dc36-527e-91c8-b7188af16e20" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$ implies $B$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-127d75f0-286e-540c-867f-af08497d27bf" :answer/id #uuid "127d75f0-286e-540c-867f-af08497d27bf" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$B$ implies $A$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-0e0b252f-632c-5fb4-955e-f2c2686886d5" :question/id #uuid "0e0b252f-632c-5fb4-955e-f2c2686886d5" :question/math-academy-id "q-183448" :question/problem "$\\,$ $P(x):$ $x=2$ $\\,$ $Q(x):$ ${x}^{2}=4$\n\nConsider the predicates $P(x)$ and $Q(x)$ above. Which of the following expresses the conditional predicate $P(x)⇒Q(x)?$\n\n- ${x}^{2}=4$ implies $x=2$\n- If ${x}^{2}=4,$ then $x=2$\n- ${x}^{2}=4$ only if $x=2$\n- ${x}^{2}=4$ if $x=2$" :question/worked-solution "Let's recall the following grammatical constructions for the implication $P⇒Q:$\n\n- If $P,$ then $Q$\n\n- $P$ only if $Q$\n\n- $Q$ if $P$\n\n- $P$ implies $Q$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine the given options.\n\n- Option I reads\n\n$$\n{{{x}^{2}=4}_{⏟}}_{Q(x)}\\,\\text{implies}\\,{{x=2}_{⏟}}_{P(x)}\n$$\n\nwhich corresponds to $Q(x)⇒P(x).$ $\\,\\times $\n\n- Option II reads\n\n$$\n\\text{if}\\,{{{x}^{2}=4}_{⏟}}_{Q(x)},\\,\\text{then}\\,{{x=2}_{⏟}}_{P(x)}\n$$\n\nwhich corresponds to $Q(x)⇒P(x).$ $\\,\\times $\n\n- Option III reads\n\n$$\n{{{x}^{2}=4}_{⏟}}_{Q(x)}\\,\\text{only if}\\,{{x=2}_{⏟}}_{P(x)}\n$$\n\nwhich corresponds to $Q(x)⇒P(x).$ $\\,\\times $\n\n- Option IV reads\n\n$$\n{{{x}^{2}=4}_{⏟}}_{Q(x)}\\,\\text{if}\\,{{x=2}_{⏟}}_{P(x)}\n$$\n\nwhich corresponds to $P(x)⇒Q(x).$ $\\,✓$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"IV only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-7423f83a-bd3f-57b5-a6e1-9ee4c5646676"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-7423f83a-bd3f-57b5-a6e1-9ee4c5646676" :answer-field/id #uuid "7423f83a-bd3f-57b5-a6e1-9ee4c5646676" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-5e1f026b-b1a3-571d-937c-f08cf77e8b6e" :answer-field/choices ["answer-4cf28c27-5628-51c2-afd9-674c7904768f" "answer-093f27fc-7e6f-5b74-9e0f-56f1dcd8da8c" "answer-27753478-b4dc-5f6b-9f5d-e4c8cf0b2741" "answer-a241a06c-b9b1-53dc-aa4f-bc3f27232754" "answer-5e1f026b-b1a3-571d-937c-f08cf77e8b6e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4cf28c27-5628-51c2-afd9-674c7904768f" :answer/id #uuid "4cf28c27-5628-51c2-afd9-674c7904768f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and IV only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-093f27fc-7e6f-5b74-9e0f-56f1dcd8da8c" :answer/id #uuid "093f27fc-7e6f-5b74-9e0f-56f1dcd8da8c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I, II and IV only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-27753478-b4dc-5f6b-9f5d-e4c8cf0b2741" :answer/id #uuid "27753478-b4dc-5f6b-9f5d-e4c8cf0b2741" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a241a06c-b9b1-53dc-aa4f-bc3f27232754" :answer/id #uuid "a241a06c-b9b1-53dc-aa4f-bc3f27232754" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III and IV only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5e1f026b-b1a3-571d-937c-f08cf77e8b6e" :answer/id #uuid "5e1f026b-b1a3-571d-937c-f08cf77e8b6e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "IV only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-baffcc7d-267a-5bc5-a0a0-d880427a8140" :question/id #uuid "baffcc7d-267a-5bc5-a0a0-d880427a8140" :question/math-academy-id "q-183424" :question/problem "Find the missing entries in the following table:\n\n| Sentence | Symbolic Form |\n| --- | --- |\n| If $A,$ then $B$ | {{field-1}} |\n| $A$ only if $B$ | {{field-2}} |\n| $B$ if $A$ | {{field-3}} |\n| $A$ implies $B$ | {{field-4}} |" :question/worked-solution "Let's recall the following grammatical constructions for the implication $P⇒Q:$\n\n- If $P,$ then $Q$\n\n- $P$ only if $Q$\n\n- $Q$ if $P$\n\n- $P$ implies $Q$\n\nLet's now compare these against the entries in our table:\n\n- \"If $A,$ then $B$\" means $A⇒B$\n\n- \"$A$ only if $B$\" means $A⇒B$\n\n- \"$B$ if $A$\" means $A⇒B$\n\n- \"$A$ implies $B$\" means $A⇒B$\n\nThe completed table is shown below.\n\n| Sentence | Symbolic Form |\n| --- | --- |\n| If $A,$ then $B$ | $A⇒B$ |\n| $A$ only if $B$ | $A⇒B$ |\n| $B$ if $A$ | $A⇒B$ |\n| $A$ implies $B$ | $A⇒B$ |" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-495d5f7c-2262-5eed-be20-cf287f9094da" "answer-field-6cffb406-744a-5f32-b94a-2cb19f02615e" "answer-field-f4204325-5ce1-5a49-85f7-bc3dc9f30912" "answer-field-5997a178-d104-5131-a6d2-b971a65e9c6f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-495d5f7c-2262-5eed-be20-cf287f9094da" :answer-field/id #uuid "495d5f7c-2262-5eed-be20-cf287f9094da" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-ae739457-85e5-5a6d-8a10-3c6f38eab1e6" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ae739457-85e5-5a6d-8a10-3c6f38eab1e6" "answer-3ec2a81b-cffd-58d4-8c3a-040f6244a1c4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ae739457-85e5-5a6d-8a10-3c6f38eab1e6" :answer/id #uuid "ae739457-85e5-5a6d-8a10-3c6f38eab1e6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "A⇒B" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3ec2a81b-cffd-58d4-8c3a-040f6244a1c4" :answer/id #uuid "3ec2a81b-cffd-58d4-8c3a-040f6244a1c4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "B⇒A" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6cffb406-744a-5f32-b94a-2cb19f02615e" :answer-field/i