enever $|x|<1$\n- $|x|<1,$ provided that $0\\le x<1$" :question/worked-solution "Given that the implication $P⇒Q$ is true, we have the following:\n\n- Whenever $P,$ then $Q$\n\n- $Q$ whenever $P$\n\n- $Q,$ provided that $P$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine the given options.\n\n- Option I reads\n\n$$\n\\text{Whenever}\\,{{|x|<1}_{⏟}}_{Q(x)},\\,\\text{then}\\,{{0\\le x<1}_{⏟}}_{P(x)}\n$$\n\nwhich corresponds to $Q(x)⇒P(x).$ $\\,\\times $\n\n- Option II reads\n\n$$\n{{0\\le x<1}_{⏟}}_{P(x)}\\,\\text{whenever}\\,{{|x|<1}_{⏟}}_{Q(x)}\n$$\n\nwhich corresponds to $Q(x)⇒P(x).$ $\\,\\times $\n\n- Option III reads\n\n$$\n{{|x|<1\\text{,}}_{⏟}}_{Q(x)}\\,\\text{provided that}\\,{{0\\le x<1}_{⏟}}_{P(x)}\n$$\n\nwhich corresponds to $P(x)⇒Q(x).$ $\\,✓$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-88cc20d1-1323-5c7b-9afb-5b2500b0cb08"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-88cc20d1-1323-5c7b-9afb-5b2500b0cb08" :answer-field/id #uuid "88cc20d1-1323-5c7b-9afb-5b2500b0cb08" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-0d40fcad-2b54-5f09-b54d-9a821f10c93a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-988b9e54-2317-550f-8181-5d56c55e2bc8" "answer-fe58e7c2-f1a1-57fe-86bd-e109566044a1" "answer-29ff0373-60cd-5181-92d4-2b66865dbf72" "answer-e436142a-6fc6-52cb-bacc-09d95d051cd7" "answer-0d40fcad-2b54-5f09-b54d-9a821f10c93a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-988b9e54-2317-550f-8181-5d56c55e2bc8" :answer/id #uuid "988b9e54-2317-550f-8181-5d56c55e2bc8" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fe58e7c2-f1a1-57fe-86bd-e109566044a1" :answer/id #uuid "fe58e7c2-f1a1-57fe-86bd-e109566044a1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-29ff0373-60cd-5181-92d4-2b66865dbf72" :answer/id #uuid "29ff0373-60cd-5